      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "However, though he kept peaceful principles without violence and terror, his mean enemies still blew up his house and attacked his relatives, and he himself couldn’t escape being sentenced to 30 years in prison. Not fearing the prison guards’ cruelty, he kept active and begged no mercy from them. As a matter of fact, he was always hopeful and never lost heart during the stage even though he was in trouble.",
        "zh": "然而，尽管他坚持和平原则，反对暴力和恐怖行为，卑鄙的敌人仍炸毁他的房子，袭击他的亲人，而他自己也没能逃过被判30年监禁的命运。他不畏惧狱警的残酷，保持积极，从不向他们乞求怜悯。事实上，在那段时期，他始终充满希望，从不灰心，即使身处困境。",
        "start": 77.98,
        "voiceEnd": 109.47666666666667,
